        before being transmitted to our servers. <strong>We do not have access to your encryption keys, PIN, or
          recovery key.</strong></p>

      <h3>8.2 Your Responsibility for Encryption Credentials</h3>
      <p>When using cloud sync, you are solely responsible for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Remembering your encryption PIN or password</li>
        <li>Safely storing your recovery key in a secure location</li>
        <li>Understanding that these credentials cannot be reset or recovered by us</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="warning-box">
        <p><strong>Critical Warning:</strong> If you forget your encryption PIN and lose your recovery key,
          <strong>your encrypted notes will be permanently inaccessible and unrecoverable.</strong> Foxbiz
          Software Pvt. Ltd. cannot decrypt, recover, or reset your encryption credentials under any
          circumstances. This is by design to ensure only you can access your encrypted data.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h3>8.3 No Liability for Encryption-Related Data Loss</h3>
      <p>You expressly acknowledge and agree that Foxbiz Software Pvt. Ltd., its officers, directors, employees,
